<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia details June inflation figures.</title>
<headline>Indonesia details June inflation figures.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is an official breakdown of Indonesia's inflation in June, according to government statistics:</p>
<p>    CPI changes     June	May	June 96</p>
<p>    Month/month    -0.17    +0.19	  -0.07</p>
<p>    Year/year	+4.98    +5.08	  +7.29</p>
<p>CPI sectors (month-on-month changes)</p>
<p>    Food	     -0.73    +0.30	  -0.50</p>
<p>    Housing	  +0.27    +0.22	  +0.17</p>
<p>    Textiles	 +0.01    +0.09	  +0.07</p>
<p>    Services	 +0.09    +0.08	  +0.19</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
